- Go templates allow reusable named blocks with `{{ define "name" }}`.
- Any page can include this nav with `{{ template "partial-admin-nav" . }}`.
- Keeping repeated navigation in one place reduces drift and makes UI updates
  safer because style/labels only change in one file.
*/}}

